Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess Sapphire\NKnight of the Ribbon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k72}{\k14}A{\k32}ta{\k40}shi {\k48}no {\k35}mi{\k52}ru {\k45}yu{\k34}me{\k30} {\k41}hi{\k44}mi{\k43}tsu {\k27}na{\k39}no{\k20}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The dreams I see are my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k53}{\k24}Da{\k13}re{\k25} {\k40}ni {\k36}mo {\k68}iwa{\k68}nai{\k56} {\k43}hi{\k40}mi{\k55}tsu {\k31}na{\k32}no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k27}{\k45}A{\k26}ka{\k22}i {\k43}man{\k19}to {\k40}hi{\k26}ra {\k23}hi{\k75}ra{\k46}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,A red cape fluttering
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k0}{\k12}U{\k25}ma {\k21}o {\k18}to{\k28}ba{\k15}su {\k91}ou{\k42}jo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Galloping on a horse—the princess
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k28}So{\k27}re {\k21}ga {\k15}a{\k12}{\k23}ta{\k31}shi{\k35}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,That’s me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:10.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:18.02,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.74,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k52}Ri{\k44}bon {\k38}no {\k35}ki{\k59}shi {\k115}wa{\k17}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The Knight of the Ribbon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k6}{\k50}Hon{\k43}to {\k33}wa {\k92}hon{\k43}tto {\k49}wa{\k24}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Truly, truly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k18}{\k23}A{\k23}ta{\k27}shi {\k35}na{\k35}no {\k159}sa{\k0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,It’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Fourteenth Episode\NThe Love Letters\NThe Seven Little Goats
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.64,0:02:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's finally finished!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.14,0:02:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The Garigori-style camera is complete!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.02,0:02:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Quickly, quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.31,0:02:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, let's give it a test run.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.76,0:02:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.14,0:02:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, hurry up, you little fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.02,0:02:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Garigori!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.40,0:02:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I hear you've invented some suspicious contraption called a camera. Is this it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.96,0:02:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you hiding inside here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.95,0:02:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no! You mustn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.99,0:02:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.88,0:02:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me look!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.95,0:03:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.81,0:03:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The carnival the other day was so much fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.73,0:03:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't enjoyed a carnival like that in a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.85,0:03:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That night at the carnival, I met a beautiful girl with flaxen hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.24,0:04:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to go on a date with her again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.83,0:04:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Please track her down and let me see her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.06,0:04:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you, Prince Franz.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.36,0:04:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,How silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.63,0:04:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That girl was Prince Sapphire all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.16,0:04:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.73,0:04:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you taking a picture or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.96,0:04:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm busy, so please make up your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.92,0:04:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, what should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.13,0:04:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry and decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.88,0:04:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,My camera is in high demand, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.18,0:04:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.59,0:04:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, wait, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.07,0:04:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you take it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.10,0:04:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, can you take a picture of me wearing this hat and dress?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.40,0:04:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.76,0:04:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess not...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.53,0:04:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, if you take a picture like that, it'll be perfect proof that you're a girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.49,0:05:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What if Duralumin got his hands on it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.09,0:05:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, what would you even do with a photo like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.32,0:05:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not telling.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.77,0:05:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my business.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.97,0:05:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand how you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.18,0:05:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The pain of having to pretend to be a boy when you were born a beautiful girl...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.86,0:05:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Garigori understands all too well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.36,0:05:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.06,0:05:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall use my skills to take just one photo in secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.40,0:05:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, look at that smile!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.80,0:05:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Franz will be amazed when he sees this photo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.70,0:05:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,To His Highness Prince Franz of Goldland.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.94,0:05:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Opal!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.36,0:05:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Go drop this letter in the mailbox.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.96,0:06:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Good boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.49,0:06:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.34,0:06:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.13,0:06:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to know who Sapphire sent a letter to and what it says.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.33,0:06:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Spy 001, Uncle Bond... I'm counting on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.18,0:06:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me, Baron Nylon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.92,0:06:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.59,0:06:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Spy News Flash: Operation Disguise!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.34,0:07:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Spy News Flash: The Great Mail Heist!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.44,0:07:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Number one-one-one-one... two-two-two-three...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.04,0:07:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my, what a cutie. Very nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.41,0:07:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Spy News Flash: Operation Mail Return!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.79,0:07:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Uncle Bond, a brilliant performance!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.80,0:07:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.84,0:07:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you saying you couldn't find Sapphire's letter?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.74,0:07:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.26,0:07:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The only other suspicious letter is the one to Prince Franz
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.83,0:07:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,on sweet-colored paper, signed "From a Girl."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.80,0:07:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.50,0:07:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,A letter for the Prince of France?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.64,0:07:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's it. So, what's inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.84,0:07:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,A single photograph!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.26,0:08:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,She was a truly beautiful girl, wasn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.11,0:08:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.92,0:08:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the letter!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.70,0:08:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Fetch that one too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.76,0:08:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Spy News Flash: Operation Retrieval!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.40,0:08:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out, you slowpoke!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.81,0:08:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Heh heh, once I get that photo...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.63,0:08:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Sapphire, what did you do with that photo?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.36,0:08:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You must make sure nobody steals it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.59,0:08:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It really is unsafe these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.63,0:08:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.17,0:08:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I heard the mail coach was attacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.34,0:08:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.16,0:08:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it, Your Highness?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.87,0:08:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did it happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.00,0:08:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Just outside the north ranch, apparently.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.07,0:08:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.63,0:08:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Opal!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.18,0:08:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,They were after my letter!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.48,0:08:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.41,0:09:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, hey, wait, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.68,0:09:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait up, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.85,0:09:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Why does the wind have to blow at a time like this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.29,0:09:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, this is getting me so panicked!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.73,0:09:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.20,0:09:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,After I finally collected them...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.48,0:09:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the mail thief!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.90,0:09:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad for you, it's got a string attached!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.38,0:09:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, you...!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.91,0:09:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Spy News Flash: Operation Tree Climb!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.30,0:09:47.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Spy News Flash: Operation Endurance!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.80,0:09:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Spy News Flash: Operation Balloon Flight!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.96,0:09:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.20,0:09:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.00,0:10:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.08,0:10:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.21,0:10:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,N-No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.33,0:10:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it, stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.14,0:10:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,No way, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.46,0:10:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.43,0:10:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.26,0:10:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.06,0:10:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, it's no good!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.24,0:10:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, give that back!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.71,0:10:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,How is darkness like a letter? The answer is... Argh, forget it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.21,0:10:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Opal!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.35,0:10:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't catch up. All right then! Spy News Flash: Operation Bunny Hop!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.83,0:10:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Spy News Flash: Operation Pardon Me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.32,0:10:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.54,0:11:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The road splits.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.81,0:11:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Which way did they go?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.97,0:11:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Spy News Flash: Operation Handbrake!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.27,0:11:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did that savage hide?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.84,0:11:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.95,0:11:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Open up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.61,0:11:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't fool us!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.41,0:11:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the seven little goats!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.84,0:12:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't let anyone in while I was gone, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.77,0:12:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,No, we didn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.43,0:12:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,There are scary humans lurking around.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.28,0:12:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You must always be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.64,0:12:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.84,0:12:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, here's a treat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.86,0:12:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, I found some delicious-looking paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.78,0:12:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give it to you for dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.71,0:12:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Open up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.83,0:12:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Aha, that's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.91,0:12:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Spy News Flash: Operation Santa Claus!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.98,0:12:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.10,0:12:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, children, hide!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.50,0:12:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.57,0:12:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.92,0:13:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Down I go, but... YEOW! HOT!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.97,0:13:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Those goat tracks are strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.21,0:13:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like wolf tracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.71,0:13:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be a wolf in disguise?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.79,0:13:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,No opening anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.78,0:13:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,They're so cautious!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.19,0:13:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Spy News Flash: Operation Snoop!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.13,0:13:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,That paper looks delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.79,0:13:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't wait until dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.32,0:13:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Just one shouldn't hurt, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.39,0:13:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, stop that!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.57,0:13:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you, leave that letter alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.17,0:13:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.93,0:13:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.95,0:13:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What a mess. What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.56,0:13:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The letter... wait, I have a brilliant idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.57,0:13:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess there's no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.95,0:13:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, this one tastes much better!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.90,0:13:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Such a waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.10,0:13:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's for work.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.91,0:14:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, give me more.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.92,0:14:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.36,0:14:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Greedy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.73,0:14:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.80,0:14:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, I'll eat this letter then.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.58,0:14:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, stop! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.16,0:14:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, I'll give it to you! Happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.60,0:14:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,One more!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.78,0:14:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.76,0:14:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,At this rate, no matter how much I have, it won't be enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.00,0:14:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I fail...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.66,0:14:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,as a spy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.39,0:14:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,There, you're fine now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.68,0:14:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to get dinner ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.85,0:14:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.48,0:14:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Dinner!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.73,0:14:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Food!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.86,0:14:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Open up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.28,0:14:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop trying to eat the little goats!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.95,0:14:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.22,0:14:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.84,0:14:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Open up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.43,0:14:42.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You dirty wolf!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.74,0:14:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Open up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.16,0:14:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Even disguised as a goat, I know you're a wolf!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.83,0:15:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,They're coming in!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.80,0:15:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't fall for that trick!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.30,0:15:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did they hide?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.69,0:15:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't take our dinner!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.23,0:15:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,How's that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.92,0:15:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,How's that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.46,0:15:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you had enough?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.67,0:16:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.58,0:16:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let the children see me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.09,0:16:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a wolf, so why are you living with those little ones?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.84,0:16:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the wife of Zubora the lynx, master of Zubora Forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.12,0:16:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,My husband Zubora ate their mother a while ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.32,0:16:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Then he ordered me to raise those little ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.00,0:16:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Zubora did?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.43,0:16:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,That cruel Zubora told you to raise those little ones?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.42,0:16:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.16,0:16:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,He's fattening them up so he can eat them himself!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.30,0:16:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That damn Zubora!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.12,0:16:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been raising these kids, pretending to be their mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.19,0:17:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,They completely believe I'm their real mother and have grown so attached to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.73,0:17:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not lying, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.56,0:17:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Please believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.98,0:17:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Lately, I’ve truly grown to love those children.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.34,0:17:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if my husband, Zubora, comes for them, I have no intention of giving them up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.51,0:17:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,A wolf raising goats... Why shouldn't a family like that exist?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.78,0:17:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,My, what a kind-hearted wolf she is, honestly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.21,0:17:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, sympathy is out of the question. I'm a spy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.81,0:17:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Spy News Flash: Operation Grass-Hide! Hah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.04,0:17:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,My husband has arrived!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.26,0:17:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The day to eat those kids has finally come!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.98,0:17:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.67,0:17:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it all right if I defeat Zubora?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.80,0:17:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.17,0:18:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,If it will save the children.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.16,0:18:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Have the kids grown big?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.40,0:18:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, they've grown big.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.27,0:18:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Are they plump enough to eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.10,0:18:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,They're nice and fat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.25,0:18:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But before eating that feast, I feel like taking a bite of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.60,0:18:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow! My tongue! Now I can't eat my feast!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.02,0:18:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.78,0:20:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if there's any beautiful scenery around.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.17,0:20:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd take some wonderful photos.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.80,0:20:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.95,0:20:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, I'll take a picture of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.90,0:20:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,S-S-S-Sapphire is in a p-p-pinch!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.43,0:20:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Sapphire, I'm here to help!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.34,0:20:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.64,0:20:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you, monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.57,0:21:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Garigori.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.30,0:21:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad you're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.43,0:21:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Spy News Flash: The return of Uncle Bond!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.49,0:21:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I finally stole it! Here it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.81,0:21:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.42,0:21:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.61,0:21:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Thief!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.20,0:21:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Thief!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.10,0:21:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Thief!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.48,0:21:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Feast!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.12,0:21:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Feast!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.36,0:21:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,My children!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.00,0:21:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a feast! We want\Nto eat! We want to eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.44,0:21:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.66,0:21:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Thief!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.82,0:21:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Feast!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.32,0:21:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Feast!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.21,0:21:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Spy News Flash: Operation Case Closed!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.28,0:22:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't blame you for being scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.10,0:22:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a wolf.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.16,0:22:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, this is our mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.82,0:22:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.13,0:22:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom, hey Mom, let's eat together.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.13,0:22:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Even in this form, you still think of me as your mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.30,0:22:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom, let's eat together. Thank you, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.53,0:22:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, enjoy your meal together.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.02,0:22:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.69,0:23:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, is it good?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.81,0:23:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.09,0:23:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, time for a photo! Everyone, huddle up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.35,0:23:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Garigori, even a wolf can become a mother goat if she tries.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.09,0:23:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll work hard to keep pretending to be a boy, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.25,0:23:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Until the day Silverland is happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.80,0:23:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.08,0:23:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
